{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00', 'title': 'EMERSON ELECTRIC CO. SOLICITS PROXIES FROM THE SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'ON NOVEMBER 27, 2019, EMERSON ELECTRIC CO. FILED A PRELIMINARY PROXY STATEMENT AND URGED THE SHAREHOLDERS OF THE COMPANY TO VOTE FOR THE COMPANY’S NOMINEES IN THE UPCOMING ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS TO BE HELD ON FEBRUARY 4, 2020.'}